{"3148560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project TurboBlast", "steam_appid": 3148560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/15002cfba59e79d367066b725f279f20.avif?t=1781390232\" width=607 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/8d6610b4726cda51613ba65eb4333db4.poster.avif?t=1781390232\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/8d6610b4726cda51613ba65eb4333db4.webm?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/8d6610b4726cda51613ba65eb4333db4.mp4?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Drift, boost, and spin around corners at BLASTING SPEEDS in Project TurboBlast ,</strong> a Singleplayer + Multiplayer arcade-style racing game blending familiar drift handling of Kart racers and tight responsive controls of classic AG racing games. With a focus on being easy to pick up but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project TURBOBLAST is a passion project</strong>. It is a love letter and homage to old school arcade racing games like F-Zero, Hotwheels, CTR and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/dddd537d03aab8569aa0325298f6b0de.poster.avif?t=1781390232\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/dddd537d03aab8569aa0325298f6b0de.webm?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/dddd537d03aab8569aa0325298f6b0de.mp4?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Grand prix Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST MODE</strong><br>A survival mode inspired by Wipeout's Zone mode, where you progressively get faster and faster. Can you handle the speed? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/f3f4f690a14f0239026e512b0775e5dd.poster.avif?t=1781390232\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/f3f4f690a14f0239026e512b0775e5dd.webm?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/f3f4f690a14f0239026e512b0775e5dd.mp4?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Time Trails, Ghost data + leaderboards</strong><br>Race against multiple ghosts from the online leaderboard, all at once! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/80b807642a97d5fdea551f7b83c4f5ce.poster.avif?t=1781390232\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/80b807642a97d5fdea551f7b83c4f5ce.webm?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/80b807642a97d5fdea551f7b83c4f5ce.mp4?t=1781390232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> <br>Race against your friends, and make new ones!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mod + Workshop Support</strong> <br>Custom tracks and vehicles planned during early access!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Vehicle Customization</strong> <br>Custom wraps ,colors and body kits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Driver Customization</strong><br>Different helmets and body mods of your choosing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/20697457b2a21b65c8d4ead7fc9f327a.avif?t=1781390232\" width=500 height=285 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYTESTING AND SUPPORT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to test pre-release content and offer feedback?</strong> Then you can join the discord! Link found in game and in the &quot;links + info&quot; section along with other platforms on this page <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/15002cfba59e79d367066b725f279f20.avif?t=1781390232\" width=607 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlisting puts Project TURBOBLAST on the map for other people</strong> , and notifies you of news and demo releases! So it helps a ton, and is deeply appreciated &lt;3</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/15002cfba59e79d367066b725f279f20.avif?t=1781390232\" width=607 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/8d6610b4726cda51613ba65eb4333db4.poster.avif?t=1781390232\" w