8560/extras/20697457b2a21b65c8d4ead7fc9f327a.avif?t=1781390232\" width=500 height=285 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYTESTING AND SUPPORT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to test pre-release content and offer feedback?</strong> Then you can join the discord! Link found in game and in the &quot;links + info&quot; section along with other platforms on this page <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/extras/15002cfba59e79d367066b725f279f20.avif?t=1781390232\" width=607 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlisting puts Project TURBOBLAST on the map for other people</strong> , and notifies you of news and demo releases! So it helps a ton, and is deeply appreciated &lt;3</p>", "short_description": "Drift, boost, and spin around corners at BLASTING SPEEDS in this stylish Singleplayer + Multiplayer Arcade Racing game, Blending the familiar drifting of Kart racers and tight responsive handling of classic Anti-Gravity racing games. With a focus on being easy to pick up but difficult to master.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/header.jpg?t=1781390232", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/24480806b6e3881ae95dfa3bbe05b976a834ba8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781390232", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148560/24480806b6e3881ae95dfa3bbe05b976a834ba8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781390232", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM MB